          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:31:58.367Z",
          "html": "<p>Today <code>a spreadsheet at</code> reads only a CSV:  no Excel reader, and it'd take a new dependency.  Which words: <a href=\"/epics/data/data.plan.html#q31\">Q31</a> (recommended:  <code>a spreadsheet at \"recipes.xlsx\"</code>, by the ending).</p>"
        },
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:47:29.783Z",
          "text": "Add phase to `data` epic to do this.",
          "edited": "2026-11-05T13:47:30.483Z"
        },
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:56:17.995Z",
          "html": "<p>Added:  <a href=\"/epics/data/data.plan.html#p38\">P38 · Excel Sheets</a>, <code>a spreadsheet at \"recipes.xlsx\"</code> picked by the file ending (Q31 A).  Its plan names the library it needs, and waits for your Accept.</p>"
        }
      ],
