    "c12": {
      "anchor": "4-writing#list-1",
      "kind": "list",
      "label": "4. Changing, undoing, healing",
      "excerpt": "A change is one field of one thing, kept on the device, sent when the action tha",
      "text": "there should also be an option to e.g. fill out an entire form with a save button, wha'ts the language for this?",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-05T13:11:11.151Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "sends several together, or none",
      "offset": 107,
      "edited": "2026-11-05T13:11:36.244Z",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:32:09.418Z",
          "html": "<p>Today:  <code>&lt;form value={a draft of the recipe}&gt;</code>, then <code>save the draft</code> or <code>discard the draft</code> (one group, one Undo).  A shorter way, the form making the draft itself: <a href=\"/epics/data/data.plan.html#q36\">Q36</a> (recommended:  <code>&lt;form edits={its recipe}&gt;</code>, its submit button saving).</p>"
        },
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:50:46.344Z",
          "text": "Good, add that to this doc"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-05T13:55:17.516Z"
      },
      "working": "2026-11-05T13:55:17.516Z"
    },
