    "c22": {
      "anchor": "12-code#table-1",
      "kind": "table",
      "label": "12. Where the code is",
      "excerpt": "What Where Places, the cache, the copy on this device, writes, healing spell/uti",
      "text": "this is worth its own top-level folder next to `util`",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-05T13:20:09.954Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "Places, the cache, the copy on this device, writes, healing",
      "offset": 11,
      "edited": "2026-11-05T13:20:17.890Z",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:32:11.734Z",
          "html": "<p>J5 chose a folder of util, for fewer exports, TypeScript settings and test projects.  The census (about 200 import lines in 113 files, one exports entry, two test projects, no lint change) and the choice: <a href=\"/epics/data/data.plan.html#q38\">Q38</a> (recommended:  <code>spell/places</code>, the server half staying in server).</p>"
        },
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:54:24.462Z",
          "text": "Rationale on separate folder is that this is a place a developer will want to dig into, more important conceptually than a \"util\"",
          "edited": "2026-11-05T13:54:47.623Z"
        },
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-05T13:56:19.068Z",
          "html": "<p>Decided as Q38 A, with your reason, and added:  <a href=\"/epics/data/data.plan.html#p39\">P39 · Places Folder</a>, <code>spell/places</code> beside util, the server half staying in <code>spell/server/places</code>.  Its plan waits for your Accept.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
